  "confidence": "high",
  "researchedAt": "2026-09-10",
  "verifiedAt": null,
  "notes": "WebRCON, not Source RCON: a WebSocket at ws://{host}:{port}/{password} carrying JSON frames {Identifier, Message, Name}. rcon.web 1 selects it (the default); rcon.web 0 falls back to Source RCON on the same port. playerlist returns a JSON array of objects with SteamID, DisplayName, Ping, ConnectedSeconds, Health. ban by name requires the player to be online and broadcasts to the server; banid works offline and is silent, so it is the one recorded here. Run server.writecfg after bans to persist them. No Facepunch-official command reference was found; all four sources are community or code."
}
